    {
      "title": "Realism Mode",
      "description": "Realism Mode is a complete gameplay overhaul for Zombies, designed to make Zombies feel more grounded, dangerous, and survival-focused.\n\nThe goal is to strip away many of the arcade-style systems and replace them with mechanics that feel closer to a military survival experience.\n\nPlayers have to rely more on positioning, scavenging, weapon choice, movement, teamwork, and the environment.\n\nMajor Features:\nHeavily reduced HUD\nNo traditional Pack-a-Punch progression\nPerks removed from normal gameplay\nReworked Mystery Box\nReworked weapon rarity and attachments\nRandomized physical floor weapons\nWall-buy replacements\nPhysical ammunition and armor supplies\nScrap drops for crafting\nReworked Outbreak rewards\nPermanent character upgrades earned through gameplay\nReworked armor\nMore realistic weapon handling and recoil (PC Only)\nWeapon-specific stamina behavior\nReduced bunny hopping and movement exploits\nInjury and low-health mechanics\nAdrenaline response at critical health\nFriendly fire / team damage\nRebalanced normal, armored, special, and elite enemies\nArmored zombies are slower but significantly tougher\nRebalanced boss health for co-op\nReworked melee weapons and gun-butt attacks\nRebalanced explosives and launchers\nVehicle durability\nOutbreak progression and loadout persistence\nReworked side-objective rewards\nTrials reintroduced with Realism-specific rewards",
      "author": {
        "discordName": "saintvertigo",
        "id": "684408486456852481",
        "name": "saintvertigo"
      },
      "publishedBy": null,
      "developer": true,
      "sourceSha256": "a2a5330daf71d9644365fee27cc963de11c99f9ae6c022630bee14162af59576",
